---
/**
 * The Problem section — why most websites underperform.
 * Bright, spacious layout. Concrete stats anchored to real impact.
 * Static Astro component.
 */
---

<section class="py-28 md:py-36 bg-[#f5f5f3]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-20 md:mb-28 max-w-3xl">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gray-400 uppercase mb-5 font-body"
      >
        The Problem
      </p>
      <h2
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 leading-tight mb-8"
      >
        Right now, your website is turning people away.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Not because of how it looks — because of how it performs.
        Every extra second of load time is a customer who gave up and went to your competitor instead.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats — concrete, anchored to physical equivalents -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-16">
      <div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-14">
        <p class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 mb-4">
          53%
        </p>
        <p class="text-base font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          of visitors leave if your page takes more than <strong class="text-gray-950">3 seconds</strong> to load. That's half your traffic — gone before they see a word.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-14">
        <p class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 mb-4">
          70%
        </p>
        <p class="text-base font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          of small business websites <strong class="text-gray-950">fail Google's Core Web Vitals</strong>. If yours is one of them, you're invisible to searchers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-14">
        <p class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-950 mb-4">
          0.63%
        </p>
        <p class="text-base font-body text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          of people click a result on <strong class="text-gray-950">page two of Google</strong>. If your site is slow, that's where it ends up.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA — testable claim, invites them to verify -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
      <a
        href="/performance-scanner"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-10 py-5 rounded-lg bg-gray-950 text-white font-heading font-bold text-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-gray-800 active:scale-[0.97]"
      >
        See how your site scores
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="22"
          height="22"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M7 17 17 7"></path>
          <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <span class="text-sm font-body text-gray-400">Free. Takes 30 seconds.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
